This blog is your one-stop DP handbook: from basics → classics → advanced problems.
DP = Overlapping Subproblems + Optimal Substructure
Recursion → Brute force (exponential)
Memoization (Top-Down) → Cache results, cut overlap
Tabulation (Bottom-Up) → Iterative, space-optimized
